# Engine

`packages/engine` is pure TypeScript.

- Do not import React, React Native, Expo, or any I/O.
- Every exported function has a Vitest test in `packages/engine`, including edge cases (empty, zero, incomplete sets).
- Volume, Epley, PR detection, progression, and unit conversion stay deterministic.
- The engine suggests. It does not write workout history.
